{"channelId":"UC_S3xS5AjcFScaDRgdT9puw","row":["Ziggy's Refuge Farm Sanctuary",9830,"Welcome to Ziggy’s Refuge, where love knows no limits! We are a 501c3 farm animal sanctuary dedicated to rescuing the most neglected, abused, and disabled farm animals, giving them the second chance they deserve. From heartwarming transformations to everyday moments of joy, our channel takes you inside the lives of these incredible animals as they heal, thrive, and experience unconditional love.\n\nWe have 87 permanent residents, 30 of them living with special needs. Here, we believe that just because an animal is disabled or deemed “unwanted” doesn’t mean they don’t deserve to live a happy, fulfilling life. Every day, we prove that with compassion and dedication, even the most vulnerable souls can flourish.\n\nSubscribe to follow our journey, meet our amazing residents, and be part of a movement that values every life. Together, we can change the world—one rescue at a time! ❤️","info@ziggysrefuge.org; kristin.hartness@gmail.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_S3xS5AjcFScaDRgdT9puw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_S3xS5AjcFScaDRgdT9puw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:09.336Z","channelId":"UC_S3xS5AjcFScaDRgdT9puw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"93fddf9d67cf72a4e00a2566c2f265e1ca7e231ecd430979349a4f03ee139c5c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7f586b6bd811d2f951f30305e5724a4fc1ffd54b6ed9bf55ba57f8912949adb9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_S3xS5AjcFScaDRgdT9puw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:09.336Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_S3xS5AjcFScaDRgdT9puw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":9830,"raw":"9.83K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_S3xS5AjcFScaDRgdT9puw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:09.336Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@ziggysrefuge.org"